{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10258","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得路字 · 贾邕","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得路字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子欲适东周，门人盈岐路。\n高标信难仰，薄官非始务。\n绵邈千里途，裴回四郊暮。\n征车日云远，抚己慙深顾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}